{"unit_id":"2b2f468f6dc59b91e1d4","title":"提案一、有關內視鏡審查注意事項之審核共識，提請討論。","kind":"proposal","blocks":[{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p2-b8","raw_text":"提案一、有關內視鏡審查注意事項之審核共識，提請討論。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":28,"bbox":[36.0,290.7496032714844,456.0099792480469,308.4173278808594]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p2-b9","raw_text":"說明: \n","start_char":0,"end_char":5,"bbox":[36.0,326.7496032714844,76.4939956665039,344.4173278808594]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p2-b10","raw_text":"1. 病歷完整記載症狀，有相關臨床診斷，符合適應症，即可安排內視鏡\n","start_char":0,"end_char":34,"bbox":[57.263999938964844,362.52618408203125,559.283447265625,380.4173278808594]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p2-b11","raw_text":"檢查。不宜以症狀長短或需先治療幾次為由核刪內視鏡。也不因檢查\n","start_char":0,"end_char":31,"bbox":[85.7040023803711,400.1860046386719,559.34033203125,416.14599609375]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p2-b12","raw_text":"結果正常而核刪，唯應符合比例原則。( 症狀長短與檢查結果嚴重度\n","start_char":0,"end_char":32,"bbox":[85.7040023803711,436.2060241699219,559.3568725585938,452.97998046875]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p2-b13","raw_text":"無必然相關，治療改善也不表示沒重大問題。沒檢查前，無法知道是\n","start_char":0,"end_char":31,"bbox":[85.7040023803711,472.2060241699219,559.3807983398438,488.166015625]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p2-b14","raw_text":"否正常。) \n","start_char":0,"end_char":7,"bbox":[85.7040023803711,508.2060241699219,158.1869659423828,524.97998046875]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p2-b15","raw_text":"2. Barrett’s esophagus 內視鏡只要照片有lesion(不管長短大小)，並有病\n","start_char":0,"end_char":50,"bbox":[57.38399887084961,542.5462036132812,554.8717651367188,560.97998046875]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p2-b16","raw_text":"理報告符合Barrett esophagus( gastric metaplasia)，可使用PPI 一年，\n","start_char":0,"end_char":55,"bbox":[78.6240005493164,580.2060546875,551.3917236328125,596.97998046875]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p2-b17","raw_text":"治療期間一年內至少須經上消化道內視鏡檢查追蹤一次。(附件1)。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":33,"bbox":[78.6240005493164,616.236083984375,552.0069580078125,633.010009765625]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p2-b18","raw_text":"3. 胃部病灶切片應執行4 片以上(含)， 食道病灶切片應執行2 片以上\n","start_char":0,"end_char":37,"bbox":[57.38399887084961,650.5762329101562,544.5517578125,669.010009765625]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p2-b19","raw_text":"(含)。以上胃部及食道病灶無法達此數目應於報告中說明原因，如病\n","start_char":0,"end_char":32,"bbox":[78.6240005493164,688.236083984375,552.1368408203125,705.010009765625]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p2-b20","raw_text":"灶太小或懷疑早期癌有執行ESD(Endoscopic submucosal dissection)可\n","start_char":0,"end_char":51,"bbox":[78.6240005493164,724.2360229492188,547.6799926757812,741.0099487304688]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p3-b1","raw_text":"能。(食道切片常因出血模糊視野，造成多次切片困難。多次切片會讓\n","start_char":0,"end_char":32,"bbox":[78.6240005493164,46.136024475097656,559.264404296875,62.90998458862305]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p3-b2","raw_text":"患者之後ESD 操作困難與危險。) \n","start_char":0,"end_char":19,"bbox":[78.6240005493164,82.15604400634766,312.07696533203125,98.93000030517578]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p3-b3","raw_text":"決議：同意說明段第1、2、3 點。  \n","start_char":0,"end_char":20,"bbox":[54.02399826049805,118.15604400634766,304.6995849609375,134.1160430908203]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p3-b4","raw_text":" \n","start_char":0,"end_char":2,"bbox":[54.02399826049805,154.15603637695312,58.17359924316406,170.1160430908203]}],"source_quality":[]}